{"folder": "INBOX", "sender": "jones.harrison@brookfieldcpas.com", "cc_json": "[]", "content": "Hi Edith,

I agree that we need a single baseline workflow. From an operations standpoint, the main pressure points are intake consistency and approval timing, especially when invoices come in through different channels.

@margot.reyes, could you sanity check the approval step and confirm what level of client sign-off we want to require before we route items for posting? I am seeing a few managed clients where the current process works, but only because the team is compensating manually.

